      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "table_1",
      "quote": "Outcomes of interest are: 1. Obesity 2. Dyslipidaemia 3. Hypertension 4. Underweight 5. Overweight 6. Others (as reported per study)",
      "reason": "The review lists the outcomes of interest in Table 1 and further defines them as primary and secondary outcomes in the Methodology section (Step 7a and 7b)."
