    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "In this meta-analysis, we extracted and used measures of associations that were the most adjusted for one or more sets of potential confounders such as socio-demographic and lifestyle factors only to reduce confounding and measurement errors, ensure consistency across studies and reduce bias.",
