      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e6",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "There is no evidence of changes to processes for selecting results."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e7",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "The primary outcome of interest in the current systematic review was evidence of associations between food insecurity and key metabolic risk factors for diet-sensitive NCDs... Secondly, after identifying the spectrum of key metabolic risk factors associated with food insecurity, we sought to assess the prevalence of these metabolic risk factors among the food-insecure patients",
      "reason": "The review explicitly prioritizes the outcomes by designating them as primary and secondary outcomes."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_10b",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10b_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "For every study that met our eligibility criteria for inclusion, two reviewers working independently and in duplicate extracted essential data related to study characteristics, assessment of food insecurity, metabolic risk diagnoses, crude prevalence estimates (number of cases divided by the sample size) and outcome of interest measures (effect size data including the prevalence of key metabolic risk factors, measures of prospective associations with 95% confidence intervals, and covariates evaluated).",
      "reason": "The authors explicitly list the data items sought for extraction, including study characteristics, food insecurity assessment, metabolic risk diagnoses, prevalence estimates, outcome measures, and covariates."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10b_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "For more detail, missing details or inconsistencies, the authors of the included studies were contacted by e-mail, if any, with up to three attempts. The studies concerned were excluded after three unsuccessful attempts to contact the author.",
      "reason": "The authors describe the procedure for handling missing or unclear information, which involved contacting the original study authors up to three times, with exclusion as the consequence of failure to respond."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10b_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "A standardised data extraction tool prepared in a Google Form format, based on a checklist provided in the Cochrane Handbook for Systemic Reviews for Intervention , was ­ used 28 .",
      "reason": "The authors cite the Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Interventions as the tool used to guide the development of their data extraction checklist."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

{
