      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Lastly, to assess study methodological quality (or risk of bias) of all included studies, we used the adopted Mixed Methods Appraisal Tool (MMAT)-Version ­ 2018 21",
      "reason": "The authors specify the tool used (Mixed Methods Appraisal Tool) and the version (2018)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "The appraisal tool consists of two core assessment domains addressing the external validity (risk of selection, data collection and non-response bias) and five further assessment domains addressing the internal validity (systematic error-the risk of measurement bias and bias related to data analysis) deemed relevant to appraise the methodological quality of cross-sectional ­ studies 22,23 .",
      "reason": "The authors describe the domains assessed by the MMAT tool."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "In order to generate an overall risk of bias assessment, an overall percentage quality score was calculated for each included study (study quality of reporting) based on the assessment of each domain and the overall risk of bias across domains. The scores were interpreted as of low quality if ≤ 50%-average quality if 51-75%-and high quality if 76-100%.",
      "reason": "The authors report the rules used to derive an overall quality/risk of bias judgment (percentage scores and interpretation thresholds)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The authors used an existing tool (MMAT) and did not report adapting it."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No newly developed risk-of-bias tool was used."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e6",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "The methodological quality (or risk of bias) of each included study was assessed by two reviewers independently, using the Mixed Methods Appraisal Tool (MMAT) - Version ­ 2018 21 . ... Differences in rating quality scores were resolved by discussion among the authors until consensus was reached.",
      "reason": "The authors report that two reviewers assessed risk of bias independently and describe the disagreement-resolution procedure."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e7",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The authors did not report contacting study investigators to confirm risk-of-bias information."
